Демонстрация OrbitData Platform

Шаг 1. Передача источников данных в Kafka

docker compose start iss-producer banking-producer industrial-producer

docker compose logs iss-producer banking-producer industrial-producer --tail=8

![](docs/screenshots/Передача источников данных в Kafka.png)

Шаг 2. Проверка топиков лежащих в Kafka

docker compose exec kafka kafka-topics --bootstrap-server kafka:9092 --list

docker compose exec kafka kafka-console-consumer --bootstrap-server kafka:9092 --topic banking.transactions --from-beginning --max-messages 3

![](docs/screenshots/Проверка топиков лежащих в Kafka.png)

Шаг 3. Bronze-слой

Write-Host "`n=== SPACE ===" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Get-ChildItem storage\bronze\space\*.parquet | Select-Object -First 1 | Format-List FullName, Length, LastWriteTime

Write-Host "=== BANKING ===" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Get-ChildItem storage\bronze\banking\*.parquet | Select-Object -First 1 | Format-List FullName, Length, LastWriteTime

Write-Host "=== INDUSTRIAL ===" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Get-ChildItem storage\bronze\industrial\*.parquet | Select-Object -First 1 | Format-List FullName, Length, LastWriteTime

![](docs/screenshots/Bronze-слой.png)

Шаг 4. Наличие Silver, Gold-витрин, Data Vault (hub/sat/link), CSV и Avro.

Write-Host "`n=== SILVER ===" -ForegroundColor Green
Get-ChildItem storage\silver -Directory | ForEach-Object { "$($_.Name) → $((Get-ChildItem $_.FullName -Filter *.parquet).Count) parquet file(s)" }

Write-Host "`n=== GOLD ===" -ForegroundColor Green
Get-ChildItem storage\gold -Directory | ForEach-Object { "$($_.Name)" }

Write-Host "`n=== DATA VAULT ===" -ForegroundColor Green
Get-ChildItem storage\gold\data_vault -Directory -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | ForEach-Object { $_.Name }

Write-Host "`n=== EXPORTS (CSV / Avro) ===" -ForegroundColor Green
Get-ChildItem storage\gold\exports -Recurse -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object Name, Length

![](docs/screenshots/Наличие Silver, Gold-витрин, Data Vault (hub sat link), CSV и Avro.png)

Шаг 5. Spark SQL

docker compose exec spark-master /opt/spark/bin/spark-submit --master spark://spark-master:7077 --deploy-mode client /opt/spark/work-dir/jobs/register_hive_tables.py

